all the federated clusters.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.270
And when anyone
says control plane,

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:55.730
all it means is global
state management, right?

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:58.710
It's like a global variable
that's managed somewhere.

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:00.700
It's a fancy word for that.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:02.700
And the really nice thing
that came out recently

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:03.900
is the kubefed tool.

00:17:03.900 --> 00:17:07.162
How many of you have heard
of this or used it before?

00:17:07.162 --> 00:17:07.900
A few people.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:08.630
Cool.

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:12.560
So if you've ever set up
federated clusters before,

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:13.339
it was a pain.

00:17:13.339 --> 00:17:15.890
You had to deploy all these
