00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:51.570
So the first thing is
federated clusters require DNS.

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:54.090
And this is because if you want
to do cross-cluster service

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.860
discovery, you have to--

00:17:55.860 --> 00:18:02.150
and especially cross-cloud
service discovery--

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.660
say that 10 times fast--

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:06.270
you have to have a DNS
system that can route traffic

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.280
over the public internet.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:11.670
Even if you're using private
DNS, you still need DNS.

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:15.330
And so-- oh, hello.

