00:30:12.220 --> 00:30:13.500
balancers being created.

00:30:13.500 --> 00:30:15.210
And those are for
the database helper,

00:30:15.210 --> 00:30:17.950
which I'll get to in a second.

00:30:17.950 --> 00:30:23.220
But we also have this sweet
HTTPS load balancer created.

00:30:23.220 --> 00:30:25.920
And so you can see that we have
all our backends automatically

00:30:25.920 --> 00:30:26.887
added to it.

00:30:26.887 --> 00:30:28.220
Of course, it's not healthy yet.

00:30:28.220 --> 00:30:30.450
It's still spinning up.

00:30:30.450 --> 00:30:35.430
And each one of them has
